      "message": "Per discussion: Android API convention is to have this be a constructor on the Builder class. Dan suggests we can add that, and mark this one @hide, and because cronet ignores @hide, users that link cronet directly will be able to use this one.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 77,
